	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_swrival_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もっとも　にがさないけどなッ！▼
アイツの　チョロネコ……
ぜったいに　とりもどすッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T02:37:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T01:28:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もっとも　逃がさないけどなッ！▼
アイツの　チョロネコ……
絶対に　取り戻すッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T07:36:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T01:28:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・別方向をむいてメッセージ表示
・続けてswrival_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T01:40:18" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
