		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_swrival_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>というわけで　[Name:TrainerName ]！
これからも　たすけてくれよッ！▼
あと　ポケモンずかんも　がんばれ！▼
せいしきに　かんせいを
たのまれたのは　オマエ　だもんな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T01:51:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T01:28:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>というわけで　[Name:TrainerName ]！
これからも　助けてくれよッ！▼
あと　ポケモン図鑑も　がんばれ！▼
正式に　完成を
頼まれたのは　オマエ　だもんな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T01:51:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T01:28:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メッセージ表示後、画面上
　r13r0201に消えて行く
・画面から消えると、操作可能に
・0＝主人公名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T01:40:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:58:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_swrival_end_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『……なんだよ！▼
べつに　シロナさんの　ウワサをきいて
ちょうせんに　きたんじゃないぜッ！▼
きになったのは
かいていいせき　だよッ！▼
ほら！　コレッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T03:10:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T10:30:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『……なんだよ！▼
別に　シロナさんの　ウワサをきいて
挑戦に　来たんじゃないぜッ！▼
気になったのは
海底遺跡　だよッ！▼
ほら！　コレッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T03:10:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T10:31:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・c12でのイベント後に登場
・ポケセン入り口のそばに配置
　GRIDX＝753、GRIDZ＝301
・話かけでイベントスタート
・アイテム入手処理
　No425「ひでんマシン０６」（ダイビング）
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T11:29:28" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T10:30:52" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff00</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_swrival_end_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『それは　ダイビング！▼
おぼえた　ポケモンが　いれば
かいていに　もぐれる▼
オマエが　いなければ
いもうとの　チョロネコ……▽
レパルダスとは　あえなかったからな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T02:51:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T11:08:37" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『それは　ダイビング！▼
おぼえた　ポケモンが　いれば
海底に　潜れる▼
オマエが　いなければ
妹の　チョロネコ……▽
レパルダスとは　会えなかったからな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T02:51:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T11:20:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・アイテム入手後自動で表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T11:20:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T11:03:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff00</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_swrival_end_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さあ！　[Name:TrainerName ]ッ！！▼
ヒオウギさいきょうの　ポケモンは
どいつか　きめようぜッ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T02:56:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T11:08:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さあ！　[Name:TrainerName ]ッ！！▼
ヒオウギ最強の　ポケモンは
どいつか　決めようぜッ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T02:57:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
