		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この先　マリンチューブ
歩く　水族館</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T11:51:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
