				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・以降、海底遺跡の文字表示切替</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:22:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:45" />
