		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_end_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねんのため　つたえておくが
かいていいせきに　いくには▼
サザナミわんに　でて
ダイビングを　つかえ▼
そして　かいていいせきの　なかで
みつけた　あんごうを　おまえが▽
じぶんで　かきとめるのだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:57:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:24:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>念のため　伝えておくが
海底遺跡に　行くには▼
サザナミ湾に　でて
ダイビングを　使え▼
そして　海底遺跡の　なかで
みつけた　暗号を　おまえが▽
自分で　書き留めるのだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:57:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・海底遺跡に行く前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:20:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_end_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゲーチスさまの　しょもつに　よると
こだいの　にんげんは　ぶんしょうを▽
はんたいから　よんだらしいぞ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:57:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ゲーチスさまの　書物に　よると
古代の　人間は　文章を▽
反対から　読んでいたらしいぞ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:58:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第２階層到達前
・次のフラグが
　たっている　→sage7_end_09
　たっていない→sage7_end_10</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T06:35:02" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_end_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しょもつには
たしか　こう　しるされていた……▼
２かいに　あがったなら
もじを　１つ　ずらして　よむ▼
３かいに　あがったなら
もじを　さらに　１つずらすと▼
このばあい　ずらすとは
まえの　もじに　おきかえることだな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:58:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>書物には
たしか　こう　記されていた……▼
２階に　あがったなら
文字を　１つ　ずらして　読む▼
３階に　あがったなら
文字を　さらに　１つずらすと▼
この場合　ずらすとは
前の　文字に　置き換えることだな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:58:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第２階層到達
・次のフラグが
　たっている　→sage7_end_09
　たっていない→sage7_end_10</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T06:35:01" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_end_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たみの　あらそいを　おさめ
ひとつに　まとめたのが▽
おう　という　そんざい　なのだな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:58:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>民の　争いを　治め
一つに　まとめたのが▽
王という　存在　なのだな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:58:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第３階層到達
・次のフラグが
　たっている　→sage7_end_09
　たっていない→sage7_end_10</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T06:35:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_end_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おうは　みらいを　よみ
いきとし　いけるものと　はなし▽
たみを　まとめていた……▼
これが　しんじつ　だとすれば
まさに　えいゆうでは　ないか！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:39:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>王は　未来を　読み
生きとし　生けるものと　話し▽
民を　まとめていた……▼
これが　真実だとすれば
まさに　英雄では　ないか！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-18T13:18:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第４階層到達
・次のフラグが
　たっている　→sage7_end_09
　たっていない→sage7_end_10</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T06:32:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_end_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>けんとうの　つかない　もじもあるが
ぜんごから　さっするに……▼
とんでもなく　すばらしい　おうが
いせきで　ねむりに　ついたと▼
もし　おうの　しそんが　いるなら
とくべつな　ちからも▽
つたわっておるのかも　しれぬ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:58:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>見当の　つかない　文字もあるが
前後から　察するに……▼
とんでもなく　すばらしい　王が
遺跡で　眠りに　ついたと▼
もし　王の　子孫が　いるなら
特別な　力も▽
伝わっておるのかも　しれぬ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:58:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第４階層到達＋こだいのおうかん入手
・アイテム入手処理
　No089「おおきなしんじゅ」
・続けてsage7_end_11</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T06:54:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:44:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_end_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんと！？
さらに　すすんだ　というのか！▼
では　どんな　あんごうが
のこされて　いたのだ？▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
ふむふむ　なるほどな……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T06:40:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんと！？
さらに　進んだ　というのか！▼
では　どんな　暗号が
残されて　いたのだ？▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
ふむふむ　なるほどな……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T06:40:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・フラグに応じたメッセージを表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T06:34:21" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
