	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_end_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もっと　たんさく　するのだ！▼
かいていいせきの　あんごうは
じぶんで　かきのこすと　いい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T05:23:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:36:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もっと　探索するのだ！▼
海底遺跡の　暗号は
自分で　書き残すと　いい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T05:23:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:36:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・終了</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:48:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:36:40" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
